    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">accītus</span></b> , ūs,
			m. (only in <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>abl. sing.</i>) [accio], <i>a
				summoning to a place</i>, <i>a summons</i>, <i>a call</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">magistratus accitu istius evocantur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 3, 28, § 68</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">accitu cari genitoris,</span>”
